---
source: src/tests/keymap_baseline.rs
expression: default.concat()
---
## Normal
BeginKeySequence(Z): 'z', ^'z', ⌥'z', ^⌥'z', ⇧'z', ^⇧'z'
ConfirmSelection: Enter, ⇧Enter
EnterCommandLine: ':'
Escape: Esc, ⇧Esc
OpenModal(CommandPalette): F(1)
OpenModal(ConnectionSelector): 'c'
OpenModal(QueryHistoryPicker): ^'o'
OpenModal(Settings): ','
OpenModal(SqlModal): 's'
OpenModal(SqliteDiagnostics): ^'D', ^⇧'d'
OpenModal(TablePicker): ^'p'
Quit: 'q'
ReloadMetadata: 'r'
Scroll { target: Explorer, direction: Left, amount: Line }: 'h', Left
Scroll { target: Explorer, direction: Right, amount: Line }: 'l', Right
Select(First): 'g', Home
Select(FullPageDown): ^'f', PageDown
Select(FullPageUp): ^'b', PageUp
Select(HalfPageDown): ^'d'
Select(HalfPageUp): ^'u'
Select(Last): 'G', End
Select(Next): 'j', Down
Select(Previous): 'k', Up
Select(ViewportBottom): 'L'
Select(ViewportMiddle): 'M'
Select(ViewportTop): 'H'
SetFocusedPane(Explorer): '1', ^'1', ⌥'1', ^⌥'1', ⇧'1', ^⇧'1'
SetFocusedPane(Inspector): '2', ^'2', ⌥'2', ^⌥'2', ⇧'2', ^⇧'2'
SetFocusedPane(Result): '3', ^'3', ⌥'3', ^⌥'3', ⇧'3', ^⇧'3'
ToggleFocus: 'f'
ToggleHelp: '?'
ToggleReadOnly: ^'r'
footer: ^P:Tables  f:Focus  r:Reload  s:SQL  c:Connections  ^⇧D:Diagnostics  ^R:Read-Only  ^O:History  ?:Help  ,:Settings  F1:Palette  q:Quit
help: 1 / 2 / 3: Switch pane focus
help: Ctrl+P: Open Table Picker
help: r: Reload metadata
help: s: Open SQL Editor
help: c: Open Connection Selector
help: Ctrl+Shift+D: Open SQLite Diagnostics
help: Ctrl+O: Open Query History
palette: q: Quit application => Quit
palette: ?: Toggle help => ToggleHelp
palette: Ctrl+P: Open Table Picker => OpenModal(TablePicker)
palette: ,: Open Settings => OpenModal(Settings)
palette: f: Toggle Focus mode => ToggleFocus
palette: r: Reload metadata => ReloadMetadata
palette: s: Open SQL Editor => OpenModal(SqlModal)
palette: c: Open Connection Selector => OpenModal(ConnectionSelector)
palette: Ctrl+Shift+D: Open SQLite Diagnostics => OpenModal(SqliteDiagnostics)
palette: Ctrl+R: Enable Read-Only mode => ToggleReadOnly
palette: Ctrl+O: Open Query History => OpenModal(QueryHistoryPicker)
## CommandLine
CommandLineSubmit: Enter
ExitCommandLine: Esc
TextBackspace { target: CommandLine }: ^'h', Backspace, ^Backspace, ⌥Backspace, ^⌥Backspace, ⇧Backspace, ^⇧Backspace
TextDelete { target: CommandLine }: ^'d', Delete, ^Delete, ⌥Delete, ^⌥Delete, ⇧Delete, ^⇧Delete
