footer: 
help: y: Copy displayed text to clipboard
help: Y: Copy row as JSON to clipboard
help: j / k / ↓ / ↑ / Ctrl+N / Ctrl+P: Scroll down / up
help: h / l / ← / →: Scroll left / right
help: Ctrl+D / Ctrl+U: Scroll half page down / up
help: PageDown / PageUp / Ctrl+F / Ctrl+B: Scroll full page down / up
help: g / G / Home / End: Jump to top / bottom
help: Esc: Close Row Detail modal
